# Flow 1 — Ontology page: the domain list renders, with every seeded sample
# domain present in the workbench's domain picker.
#
# The seven names below are the sample domains this instance ships with. The
# assertion is "the domain list renders and lists at least these seven" — one
# presence check per domain, which is how a replay expresses "count >= 7"
# (the replay grammar has no counting primitive). scripts/e2e-local.sh runs
# the exact numeric count (`E2E_MIN_DOMAINS`, default 7) and prints it.
#
# Runs signed in, in the session left behind by local-auth.ad.

open ${E2E_BASE_URL}/${E2E_COMPANY_PREFIX}/ontology
wait role="combobox" 120000
find text "Fourth Coffee" exists
find text "E-Commerce Platform" exists
find text "Banking & Finance" exists
find text "Healthcare System" exists
find text "Smart Manufacturing" exists
find text "University System" exists
find text "Zava Grove-to-Shelf" exists
screenshot clients/expo/replays/evidence/ontology-domains-01-domain-list.png
